"已发布。</strong>您当前运行的是 %2$s 版。"

#: includes/functions.php:166
#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:382
msgid "Update now"
msgstr "立即更新"

#. translators: %s: Installed version number.
#: includes/functions.php:193
#, php-format
msgid "ICC.gg LLM Files Generator is up to date (version %s)."
msgstr "ICC.gg LLM Files Generator 已是最新版本（%s 版）。"

#: includes/functions.php:204
msgid ""
"The update check could not reach GitHub. Please try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "无法连接 GitHub 检查更新。请几分钟后重试。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-content-collector.php:118
msgid "(removed item)"
msgstr "（已移除条目）"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-diff-applier.php:45
msgid "Diff operations must be a JSON object."
msgstr "差异操作必须是 JSON 对象。"

#. translators: %s: operations key
#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-diff-applier.php:64
#, php-format
msgid "Diff operations key \"%s\" must be an array of strings."
msgstr "差异操作的键 “%s” 必须是字符串数组。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-diff-applier.php:74
msgid "Diff operations entries must be strings."
msgstr "差异操作的条目必须是字符串。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-diff-applier.php:85
msgid "The AI returned an empty diff."
msgstr "AI 返回了空的差异。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-diff-applier.php:104
msgid "Current file content must be a string."
msgstr "当前文件内容必须是字符串。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:311
msgid "The AI diff produced empty content."
msgstr "AI 差异产生了空内容。"

#. translators: %s: file name
#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:378
#, php-format
msgid ""
"You maintain the %s file for a WordPress site. You return ONLY strict JSON "
"describing edits to the existing file."
msgstr ""
"您负责维护 WordPress 站点的 %s "
"文件。您只返回描述现有文件编辑内容的严格 JSON。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:387
msgid ""
"Return ONLY a JSON object with keys \"insert\" (array of strings to add) and "
"\"remove\" (array of exact strings to delete). Example: {\"insert\":[\"- New "
"page: Title (https://example.com/page)\"],\"remove\":[\"- Old page: Title "
"(https://example.com/page)\"]}. Do not include Markdown fences or commentary."
msgstr ""
"只返回一个 JSON 对象，包含键 "
"\"insert\"（要添加的字符串数组）和 "
"\"remove\"（要删除的精确字符串数组）。示例：{\"insert\":[\"- New page: Title (https://example.com/page)\"],\"remove\":[\"- Old page: Title (https://example.com/page)\"]}。不要包含 Markdown 代码围栏或评论。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:416
msgid ""
"You generate SEO and LLM-friendly plain-text Markdown files for a WordPress "
"website."
msgstr ""
"您为 WordPress 网站生成有利于 SEO 和 LLM 的纯文本 "
"Markdown 文件。"

#. translators: %s: file name
#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:420
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Generate the complete %s file content for the following WordPress site. Use "
"the llms.txt convention: an H1 site title, a blockquote summary, and "
"Markdown lists of links with short descriptions."
msgstr ""
"为以下 WordPress 站点生成完整的 %s 文件内容。请遵循 "
"llms.txt 约定：一个 H1 "
"站点标题、一段引用式摘要，以及带简短描述的 "
"Markdown 链接列表。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:424
msgid ""
"Return ONLY the raw file content. Do not include Markdown fences, "
"explanations or commentary."
msgstr ""
"只返回文件的原始内容。不要包含 Markdown "
"代码围栏、说明或评论。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:455
msgid "The AI API URL is not configured."
msgstr "未配置 AI API URL。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:462
msgid "The AI API key is not configured."
msgstr "未配置 AI API 密钥。"

#. translators: %s: error message
#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:492
#, php-format
msgid "AI request failed: %s"
msgstr "AI 请求失败：%s"

#. translators: 1: HTTP status code, 2: response body
#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:506
#, php-format
msgid "The AI API returned HTTP %1$d: %2$s"
msgstr "AI API 返回 HTTP %1$d：%2$s"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:519
msgid "The AI API returned a malformed response."
msgstr "AI API 返回了格式错误的响应。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:550
msgid "The AI returned invalid JSON operations."
msgstr "AI 返回了无效的 JSON 操作。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:117
#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:118
msgid "LLM Files Generator"
msgstr "LLM 文件生成器"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:142
msgid "File Delivery"
msgstr "文件分发"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:149
msgid "AI Settings"
msgstr "AI 设置"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:209
msgid "Enable llms.txt"
msgstr "启用 llms.txt"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:210
msgid "Deliver the concise /llms.txt index to visitors and AI agents."
msgstr "向访问者和 AI 代理提供精简的 /llms.txt 索引。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:215
msgid "Enable llms-full.txt"
msgstr "启用 llms-full.txt"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:216
msgid "Deliver the full /llms-full.txt content to visitors and AI agents."
msgstr "向访问者和 AI 代理提供完整的 /llms-full.txt 内容。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:221
msgid "AI API URL"
msgstr "AI API URL"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:222
msgid ""
"The OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint URL. Leave empty to disable "
"AI-assisted generation."
msgstr ""
"兼容 OpenAI 的 chat completions 接口 URL。留空可禁用 AI "
"辅助生成。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:231
msgid "API Key"
msgstr "API 密钥"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:232
msgid ""
"The API key used to authenticate with the AI API. Stored in the WordPress "
"options table."
msgstr ""
"用于向 AI API 进行身份验证的 API 密钥。存储在 "
"WordPress 选项表中。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:237
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:238
msgid "The AI model name used for chat completions."
msgstr "用于 chat completions 的 AI 模型名称。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:334
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:337
msgid "llms.txt"
msgstr "llms.txt"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:341
msgid "llms-full.txt"
msgstr "llms-full.txt"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:348
msgid "Last generation warning"
msgstr "上次生成警告"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:356
msgid ""
"ICC.gg LLM Files Generator - llms.txt / llms-full.txt Generator for WordPress"
msgstr ""
"ICC.gg LLM Files Generator - 适用于 WordPress 的 llms.txt / "
"llms-full.txt 生成器"

#. translators: %s: New version number.
#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:374
#, php-format
msgid "Update available: v%s"
msgstr "有可用更新：v%s"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:467
msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:480
msgid "Control which generated files are delivered to visitors and AI agents."
msgstr "控制向访问者和 AI 代理分发哪些生成的文件。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:489
msgid ""
"Configure an OpenAI-compatible chat completions API to assist with file "
"generation. Leave the API URL empty to use deterministic generation only."
msgstr ""
"配置兼容 OpenAI 的 chat completions API "
"以辅助生成文件。将 API URL 留空则仅使用确定性生成。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:511
msgid "Security check failed. Please try again."
msgstr "安全校验失败。请重试。"

#. translators: %s: warning message
#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:538
#, php-format
msgid "Files generated using the deterministic fallback. AI warning: %s"
msgstr "使用确定性后备方案生成了文件。AI 警告：%s"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:549
msgid "Files generated successfully!"
msgstr "文件生成成功！"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:564
msgid "Generate Files"
msgstr "生成文件"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:568
msgid ""
"Click the button below to generate (or regenerate) the llms.txt and llms-"
"full.txt files immediately."
msgstr ""
"点击下方按钮立即生成（或重新生成）llms.txt 和 "
"llms-full.txt 文件。"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:572
msgid "Last updated"
msgstr "上次更新"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:578
